{"id":"n1-207","title":"～とみえて","romaji":"〜to miete","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"It seems that; apparently","longExplanation":"The ～とみえて grammar point is used to express the speaker's judgment about a situation based on visible or known information. It is often translated as 'apparently' or 'it seems that' in English.","formation":"Verb-casual + とみえて, い-Adjective + とみえて, な-Adjective + だとみえて, Noun + だとみえて","examples":[{"jp":"彼は運動が得意とみえて、毎日ジムに行っています。","romaji":"Kare wa undou ga tokui to miete, mainichi jimu ni itteimasu.","en":"He seems to be good at exercise, as he goes to the gym every day.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"運動","vocabId":"1172910","reading":"うんどう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"得意","vocabId":"1454510","reading":"とくい"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みえ","vocabId":"1578350","reading":"みえ","baseForm":"みえる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"毎日","vocabId":"1524720","reading":"まいにち"},{"surface":"ジム","vocabId":"1314270","reading":"じむ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行っています","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いっています","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"彼女は忙しいとみえて、なかなか会えない。","romaji":"Kanojo wa isogashii to miete, nakanaka aenai.","en":"She seems to be busy, as it's hard to meet her.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"忙しい","vocabId":"1519290","reading":"いそがしい"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みえ","vocabId":"1578350","reading":"みえ","baseForm":"みえる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なかなか","vocabId":"1599420","reading":"なかなか"},{"surface":"会え","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"会える"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"田中さんは疲れているとみえて、早く帰りました。","romaji":"Tanaka-san wa tsukarete iru to miete, hayaku kaerimashita.","en":"It seems that Tanaka-san was tired, as he went home early.","words":[{"surface":"田中","vocabId":null},{"surface":"さん","vocabId":"1579350","reading":"さん"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"疲れている","vocabId":"1483740","reading":"つかれている","baseForm":"疲れる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みえ","vocabId":"1578350","reading":"みえ","baseForm":"みえる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"早く","vocabId":"1404975","reading":"はやく","baseForm":"早い"},{"surface":"帰りました","vocabId":"1221270","reading":"かえりました","baseForm":"帰る"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]},{"jp":"その店は人気だとみえて、いつも行列ができている。","romaji":"Sono mise wa ninki da to miete, itsumo retsu ga dekite iru.","en":"That shop seems to be popular, as there is always a line.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"店","vocabId":"1582120","reading":"みせ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"人気","vocabId":"1367010","reading":"にんき"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みえ","vocabId":"1578350","reading":"みえ","baseForm":"みえる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いつも","vocabId":"1188890","reading":"いつも"},{"surface":"行列","vocabId":"1282220","reading":"ぎょうれつ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でき","vocabId":"1340430","reading":"でき","baseForm":"できる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]}],"formalityLevel":"very-formal-literary","usageNote":"Formal, literary observational inference - \"it appears that (judging from what I see)\".","family":{"id":"inference","name":"Inference (It Seems / Probably)","relatedPoints":["n4-091","n4-119","n3-118","n4-094","n3-055","n3-126","n4-077","n3-106","n1-205","n2-146"]}}